                "Bandits over the Central Valley. Breaking left, follow me.",
                "Found the {rival} raid. Pushing an update to their plans.",
            ],
            jumped: [
                "{rival} fighters came out of the sun! Hold it together!",
                "Bandits, six o'clock! This was not in the spec!",
                "We've got company. Stay tight, keep going.",
                "{rival} jumped us. Rerouting, stay with me.",
                "Surprise meeting with {rival} fighters. Push through.",
            ],
